<div class="container prose">
  <p>This policy describes how {{ site.name }} (“we,” “us”) may collect, use, and protect information you provide when you use our website or contact us for services in Texas.</p>
  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Contact details</strong> you submit via phone, email, or forms, such as name, address, phone number, and service needs.</li>
    <li><strong>Technical data</strong> from your browser, including IP address and general location, standard server logs, and cookies if enabled.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>How we use information</h2>
  <p>We use your information to schedule appointments, deliver estimates, communicate about services, improve our website, and comply with legal obligations. We do not sell your personal information.</p>
  <h2>Sharing</h2>
  <p>We may share limited information with payment processors, scheduling tools, or insurers as needed to operate the business. Those vendors are expected to protect data consistent with their agreements and applicable law.</p>
  <h2>Security</h2>
  <p>We apply reasonable administrative and technical safeguards appropriate to a small service business. No online transmission is completely secure; please call for highly sensitive matters if you prefer.</p>
  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>You may request access or correction of contact information we maintain for service records by emailing {{ site.email }}. You can disable non-essential cookies in your browser where applicable.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about privacy: <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a> or <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneTel }}">{{ site.phoneDisplay }}</a>.</p>
